<XPD:OBJ name="OwnedElements[0]" type="UMLModel" guid="4eLfsGT7T3qvRMUCAOjsxwAA">
<XPD:ATTR name="Name" type="string">Use Case Model</XPD:ATTR>
<XPD:ATTR name="Documentation" type="string">Derived from supplied SRS. Human and external-system roles are actors; internal databases, UI devices and REST endpoints are not actors. Include arrows point to mandatory reused behaviour; extend arrows point to a base use case and carry a condition in Documentation. Generalization arrows point from a specialized actor/use case to its parent. Staff operations require role-based authorization. Performance and platform constraints remain non-functional requirements.</XPD:ATTR>
